'''KR Core OS''' is a library for modders to use in their mods. Currently the library provides the following features:
* Item Distribution API - helps register items into specific [[Procedural distributions]] thanks to a categorization of the different available distributions in [[PZ Loot Containers]]
* Vehicle Distribution API - register custom vehicles into the world spawn zones (parking lots, traffic jams, junkyards, etc)

== See also ==
* [[Easy Distributions API]]
* [[PZ Loot Containers]]

